message: "If you use or reference the Volt Inference Price Index (VIPI), please cite it as below."
title: "Volt Inference Price Index (VIPI)"
version: "0.1.5"
date-released: 2026-06-16
abstract: "A daily-fix price index for AI inference across a curated basket of providers. The methodology covers basket selection rules, anomaly handling, chain-of-custody documentation, and a daily fix at 16:07 UTC. Designed for inference cost forecasting, contract benchmarking, derivative reference rates, and academic research on AI inference pricing."
